<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav July retail sales rise 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav July retail sales rise 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES	JULY	   JUNE	  JULY 1995</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	  + 5.0	  - 1.0	    N.A.</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	   +104.0	  +97.0	    N.A.</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO JULY)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	   +103.0	 +103.0	    N.A.</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom +381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
